pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: concept-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 44, 400, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [left, middle]
      text: CONCEPT · 01
  - elementId: concept-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 88, 832, 190]
    content:
      fontSize: 54
      fontFamily: "Smiley Sans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.08
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        Make the ordinary
        shelf feel like
        a gallery.
  - elementId: pillar-rule-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 318, 240, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: pillar-rule-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [360, 318, 240, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: pillar-rule-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [656, 318, 240, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: pillar-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 332, 240, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Frame the product
  - elementId: pillar-1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 360, 240, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: One object per frame, generous margin, no price noise nearby.
  - elementId: pillar-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 332, 240, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Keep one blue
  - elementId: pillar-2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 360, 240, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: The field is the signature; packaging, shelf, and social share it.
  - elementId: pillar-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [656, 332, 240, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Number the series
  - elementId: pillar-3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [656, 360, 240, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: The index numeral becomes the collecting mechanism across launches.
  - elementId: concept-fit
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 452, 832, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: "Why it fits: the audience already treats the category as self-care, not grocery; the brand needs a frame, not a new product."
  - elementId: concept-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 504, 28, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "04"
